 "note": "คีย์ชนิดข้อมูล (path/id/ธง) ถูกตัดออกแล้วโดย mark_dnt.py — แปลเฉพาะที่เหลือ",
 "strings": {
  "How's that injury doing?": "",
  "You just watch!\nI'll stop any blade!": "",
  "Wasn't I supposed to\ndo some cleaning?": "",
  "I miss home...\nI can't take much more of this.": "",
  "I got plenty to say!": "",
  "I'll cut down everybody\nwho gets in my way!": "",
  "You new or somethin'?": "",
  "Let's get this\nover with and eat.": "",
  "Well... Guess I'm up next...": "",
  "Bushido? Who gives a shit\nabout that anymore?": "",
  "I'm feeling more and more\ndepressed lately.": "",
  "Everything's just so\neasy for you, isn't it!?": "",
  "You boys are too soft!\nLife is going to chew you up!": "",
  "Tch, what an ass...": "",
  "I'm beaten, I'm sore, I'm tired.": "",
  "All these idiots are\ntaking things so seriously.": "",
  "Don't go so hard all the time.": "",
  "My skills are getting dull.": "",
  "I'm starving!": "",
  "My blood's been boilin' lately.": "",
  "We've just got to\nact like samurai, right?": "",
  "I won't abandon my training!": "",
  "Man, screw training!": "",
  "Whoever loses buys supper!": "",
  "Maybe I should blow off some\nsteam at the gambling den?": "",
  "Isn't there a tea parlor nearby?": "",
  "I could sure use\na drink, couldn't you?": "",
  "Ugh, what a pain it all is!": "",
  "Please, just keep this quiet...": "",
  "Long day. Let's get\nsomething to eat.": "",
  "Let's get drunk.": "",
  "Make a fool out of me, huh!?": "",
  "I refuse to die\nfor a shitty cause!": "",
  "You're all a bunch of wastrels!": "",
  "Ahhh...": "",
  "Wonder if I'll even\nsee tomorrow...": "",
  "Leave me be!": "",
  "You never shoulda\ncome down this way!": "",
  "Get outta here, moron!": "",
  "Why'd I bet that much!?\nDamn it all!": "",
  "Dammit, I lost out\non a good lead.　": "",
  "Think I'll just... lie down\nand go to sleep...": "",
  "Life was always\ngonna be this way.": "",
  "Ain't nothing lower than this.": "",
  "All of this is your fault!": "",
  "Who're you!?": "",
  "Oi, what happened\nto the drink I had!?": "",
  "Never thought this\nwould be my life...": "",
  "This is the last time...": "",
  "This whole damn city\nis rotten to the core!": "",
  "I can't eat this crap!": "",
  "I'm beggin' ya, gimme a drink!": "",
  "Pour me out some\nof that, won't ya?": "",
  "Hey, friend, got some coin\nI could borrow? I'll pay ya back!": "",
  "What d'ya want from me!?": "",
  "I think I might be goin' crazy.": "",
  "I don't care if I live or die!": "",
  "The hell are we supposed to do?": "",
  "How do you plan\nto make up for this?": "",
  "What am I going to do...": "",
  "They call this place\nDead Man's Alley...": "",
  "What the hell's goin' on\nin this world!?": "",
  "What're you sleeping for!?": "",
  "What're you lookin' at!?": "",
  "You trying to screw with me?\nI'll gut you!": "",
  "Got nothin' to say, huh?\nGet outta my face, then!": "",
  "Eh? You got something\nto say to me!?": "",
  "You gotta be shittin' me...": "",
  "Screw you! Screw all of you!": "",
  "Ugh, not you again.": "",
  "Life pisses in my\nmouth once again...": "",
  "Am I lost again?": "",
  "I ain't a loser!\nNot yet, anyway...": "",
  "Is there anyone in their\nright mind around here!?": "",
  "Hell with it.\nNothing matters anymore.": "",
  "I give up. I don't care anymore.": "",
  "Can't take it no more...": "",
  "This is how it\nends for me, isn't it?": "",
  "It's all over for me...": "",
  "We'll pay 'em back!\nA hundred times over!": "",
  "I gotta get some booze in me...": "",
  "Hm? Oh, damn, just a pebble.": "",
  "Hm? Aw, just some\ntrash on the ground.": "",
  "Aw, damn it all!": "",
  "Ripped off again...": "",
  "My life's just one big mess.": "",
  "I'm flat broke.\nWhere I can make some quick coin?": "",
  "I'm gonna turn it all around!\nTomorrow...": "",
  "Another day, another\nload of shit.": "",
  "Give me back the\ntime I've wasted!": "",
  "Gimme my money back,\nyou con artist!": "",
  "Ain't my fault\nI ended up here...": "",
  "There's no more reason\nto fight. We all lost down here.": "",
  "Mercy! Please!": "",
  "What's there to do but complain?": "",
  "What do I even do come tomorrow?": "",
  "I used to be a pretty famous\nsamurai, you know.": "",
  "Ain't had a bit to eat\nsince yesterday...": "",
  "Please, don't hit me!": "",
  "I'm gonna be sick!": "",
  "I think I caught something.\nI feel sick.": "",
  "Piss off!": "",
  "Who even cares?": "",
  "People like you make me laugh!": "",
  "Damn, I'm starving...": "",
  "Urgh... It hurts so much...": "",
  "They stabbed me in the back!\nAll of them!": "",
  "Who took it!?": "",
  "Who d'ya think yer\neven talkin' to!?": "",
  "I just can't break\nthis losing streak.": "",
  "Take responsibility\nfor yourself, you tramp!": "",
  "Get away from me! Back off!": "",
  "I'm just killing time out here.": "",
  "I can turn my fortunes around,\njust need one good break.": "",
  "Please... I just need a drink...": "",
  "Booze!": "",
  "Come on, let's get a drink.": "",
  "Pass that bottle\nmy way, would ya?": "",
  "My lips're chapped!\nI need to wet my whistle!": "",
  "If I had money, things\nwould be different!": "",
  "Ain't got dick to my name...": "",
  "Money never betrays you!": "",
  "Spent too much again...": "",
  "I found some coins!": "",
  "Somebody stole\neverything from me.": "",
  "Maybe somebody dropped\nsomething valuable...": "",
  "My head won't stop pounding...": "",
  "That's quite enough from you!": "",
  "Is that really true!?": "",
  "Isn't there anything\nfun around here?": "",
  "Not as funny, that one.": "",
  "Would you please\nquit bragging so much?": "",
  "C'mon, sit down and have\na drink with me.": "",
  "This doesn't seem\nlike it should be legal...": "",
  "Huh? There a fight goin' on!?": "",
  "I musta dropped it\nsomewhere 'round here...": "",
  "Ah, fine. Whatever!": "",
  "Scooch over!": "",
  "You'll never make it\nbeing a cheapskate!": "",
  "Sounds like a plan!": "",
  "How are things on your end?": "",
  "You know, I think I'll take\nyou up on that one!": "",
  "That sounds like fun!": "",
  "Heheh, too easy!": "",
  "Yeah? What do you need from me?": "",
  "Hey, move!": "",
  "Where are you headed?": "",
  "Hey! You need to pay for that!": "",
  "So, what do you want me to do?": "",
  "What's going on around here?": "",
  "You trying to take\nadvantage of me?": "",
  "Oh, so that's how\nit's gonna be? Fine.": "",
  "Ugh, what the heck!": "",
  "You better not\nbe laughing at me!": "",
  "Bring on the booze!\nBring on the booze!": "",
  "Come on, hurry up!": "",
  "Whew...": "",
  "Quit screwing around!": "",
  "Heheh, got a nice job for ya!": "",
  "All right, let's get going!": "",
  "Whoa, really!?": "",
  "Things are none too bad here.": "",
  "Who cares? Let's just\npour back another round.": "",
  "Hey, just hear me out!": "",
  "I got a job for you\nthat you're going to love!": "",
  "More booze over here, quick!": "",
  "Aw, would ya shuddup!?": "",
  "Damn, I love sake!": "",
  "Just forget it, all right?": "",
  "I knew it! I'm a genius!": "",
  "Eh!? Oh, I think I was\nhavin' a nightmare...": "",
  "Hm? Got somethin' to say!?": "",
  "Hm? Hey, I just found\na free wallet!": "",
  "Ya really think I'd lie to you!?": "",
  "Don't be stupid!": "",
  "Just one drink!": "",
  "Nothing more important\nin this world than money...": "",
  "I'll show you! Just you watch!": "",
  "I'm rich!\nEverything paid off today!": "",
  "I should probably be\nlooking for a job...": "",
  "Can we please\nchange the subject?": "",
  "You looking my way, eh?": "",
  "Why don't you come make\nsome money with me?": "",
  "Give it here!": "",
  "At last, I'm coming into my own!": "",
  "Hey man, looking to get rich?": "",
  "You trying to\nstart a fight, buddy!?": "",
  "You must be out of your mind!": "",
  "I've been so busy lately...": "",
  "Something about\nthis smells fishy...": "",
  "I'll believe it when I see it.": "",
  "This is just the pits!": "",
  "Ugh, spent every\ndamn coin I had...": "",
  "Hey, that's real generous of ya!": "",
  "We're all gonna be rich!": "",
  "Someone pilfered my wallet\nfrom right under me!": "",
  "No solicitors!\nGet out of here, you bums!": "",
  "How about we head over\nto the gambling den?": "",
  "I say we go triple that money\nat the den, don't you?": "",
  "Your ugly face is making\nmy sake go sour!": "",
  "No job, no money, no worries!": "",
  "Think there's any money\nlying around outside?": "",
  "I got duped real\ngood this time...": "",
  "Gotta learn to spot the\nswindlers or you're done for!": "",
  "I saw a dog down\nthat way recently!": "",
  "Hahaha! That's funny!": "",
  "This sure is a lovely town.": "",
  "This was wonderful but\nI should be getting home.": "",
  "What's going on today?": "",
  "What can I get you?": "",
  "So much to do, so little time!": "",
  "There are so many places\nto go—I can't choose one!": "",
  "Hmm, where should we go?": "",
  "Where are you off to this time?": "",
  "Hm? What's happening?": "",
  "Hm? Is something wrong?": "",
  "You should probably hurry\nif you're going to be on time.": "",
  "I must be on my way, I think.": "",
  "Hey, come on, don't be late!": "",
  "Up and at 'em!": "",
  "Wait, can you say\nthat one more time?": "",
  "Ah! What a great sleep!": "",
  "I slept very well, thank you!": "",
  "You don't say?": "",
  "Tell me what's been up!": "",
  "Maybe I should pick\nup some souvenirs.": "",
  "Sure is relaxing here.": "",
  "You're not going that way?": "",
  "Wanna go chase it!?": "",
  "Haha, you're too slow!": "",
  "Didn't you want to\nget something to eat?": "",
  "How about some food?": "",
  "Y'can bet the magistrate'll\nhear of it!": "",
  "That looks right tasty!": "",
  "Cute as a button!": "",
  "Real nice, that is!": "",
  "How nice it is to\nsee a thing like that!": "",
  "Been lookin' forward\nto that, I have...": "",
  "Don't be doin' it half-assed!": "",
  "I'm bein' serious\nas a spitfire here!": "",
  "Can hardly wait for it!": "",
  "Testy fella, isn't he?": "",
  "Sorry to trouble ya!": "",
  "Yeah, whatcher point?": "",
  "What are you on about?": "",
  "We've been gettin'\non well lately.": "",
  "He's yankin' your chain!": "",
  "Eh? Come again?": "",
  "Quit your schemin', dumbo!": "",
  "Quit blowin' smoke!": ""
 }
}